<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kasus 1: Antrian Printer Bersama</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .slide {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 40px;
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 900px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h1 { color: #333; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 30px; font-style: italic; }

        .container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .box {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-left: 5px solid #2196F3;
        }

        .box h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #2196F3;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        ul { line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }

        .code-box {
            flex: 1;
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            color: #d4d4d4;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            white-space: pre;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="slide">
    <h1>Kasus 1: Antrian Printer Bersama</h1>
    <p>Dokumen dicetak sesuai urutan kedatangan</p>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="box">
            <h2>Skenario</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Banyak user mengirim dokumen ke 1 printer</li>
                <li>Printer hanya bisa cetak 1 dokumen pada satu waktu</li>
                <li>Dokumen yang datang duluan, dicetak duluan (FIFO)</li>
                <li><strong>enqueue():</strong> user mengirim dokumen baru</li>
                <li><strong>dequeue():</strong> printer mulai cetak dokumen berikutnya</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="code-box">
printer_queue = Queue()

# User mengirim dokumen
printer_queue.enqueue("laporan.pdf")
printer_queue.enqueue("tugas.docx")
printer_queue.enqueue("foto.jpg")

# Printer memproses
while not printer_queue.isEmpty():
    doc = printer_queue.dequeue()
    print(f"Mencetak: {doc}")

# Output:
# Mencetak: laporan.pdf
# Mencetak: tugas.docx
# Mencetak: foto.jpg
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
